From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Lu=C3=ADs=20Duarte?= <lduarte@cloudflare.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 23:30:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Bulk servo enablement: 41 gecko-gated longhands + 6
 shorthands

The remaining parse-only property batches, same pattern as the
accent-color, @page and break-* enablements: drop the engine=gecko
gates so servo generates them.

- css-text: text-wrap-style, hyphens, hyphenate-character,
  hyphenate-limit-chars, text-autospace (and the text-wrap shorthand)
- css-fonts: font-size-adjust, font-palette, font-variant-emoji,
  font-variant-alternates, font-synthesis-{style,small-caps,position}
  (and the font-synthesis shorthand)
- anchor-position: anchor-scope, position-try-order,
  position-visibility (and the position-try shorthand; its
  position-try-fallbacks sub-longhand loses the layout.unimplemented
  servo_pref)
- css-shapes: shape-outside, shape-margin, shape-image-threshold
- text-decor: text-emphasis-{style,position,color},
  text-underline-position, text-decoration-{inset,skip-ink} (and the
  text-emphasis shorthand)
- multicol: column-rule-{style,color,width}, column-fill (and the
  column-rule shorthand)
- contain-intrinsic-{width,height,block-size,inline-size} (and the
  contain-intrinsic-size shorthand)
- others: counter-set, resize, field-sizing, transform-box,
  image-orientation, text-orientation, text-combine-upright,
  scrollbar-gutter

The five handwritten shorthand modules in shorthands.rs were
cfg(gecko)-gated like page-break-*; un-gate them. Servo's font style
struct derives serde, so the newly reachable font value types
(FontPalette, GenericFontSizeAdjust, FontSynthesisStyle,
FontVariantAlternates and VariantAlternates, CustomIdent) gain the
same cfg_attr(servo) serde derives the sibling types carry.

content-visibility stays gecko-gated: its Animate impl is gecko-only,
and whether blitz honours 'hidden' is unverified.
